  "expected_vs_observed": [
    {
      "case": "base still moving (0-4 s of the mock)",
      "expected": "arm request forbidden",
      "observed": "gate reasons BASE_STILL_MOVING / NAV2_GOAL_ACTIVE / CMD_VEL_NONZERO in the first gate samples (see gate_timeline_compact)"
    },
    {
      "case": "Nav2 SUCCEEDED + docking DOCKED",
      "expected": "ARRIVED only, no success flag",
      "observed": "arrival.nav2_status=DOCKED, manipulation_succeeded=False"
    },
    {
      "case": "detector re-publishes one sensor frame as new PoseStamped (EMA)",
      "expected": "refused",
      "observed": "REOBSERVE: OBSERVATION_TOO_OLD + EMA_FILTER_CARRYOVER_FROM_MOTION_FORBIDDEN; arm_commands_invoked_count=0"
    },
    {
      "case": "fresh raw frames with sidecar + tf2 lookup at sensor time",
      "expected": "MANIPULATION_READY, no ARM_TASK",
      "observed": "stopped_at MANIPULATION_READY:ARM_TASK_NOT_REQUESTED_IN_DRYRUN; arm_commands_invoked_count=0"
    },
    {
      "case": "live graph with nothing running",
      "expected": "NO_DATA, stop at ARRIVED",
      "observed": "data_origin NO_DATA, ARRIVED:NO_NAV2_TERMINAL_STATUS_OBSERVED"
    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "MOCK_ROS_GRAPH runs prove the adapter path and the refusal rules, not the robot: static TF values are URDF/launch copies, poses are synthetic.",
    "The sidecar topic does not exist in the current Navigation code; until proposals/C2_object_detector_3d_provenance_sidecar.patch (or an equivalent) is applied, every real post-stop observation is refused as POST_STOP_OBSERVATION_UNVERIFIED by design.",
    "map<-base_footprint lookup at the arrival stamp sometimes misses in the mock (dynamic /tf timing); the adapter then labels the pose frame 'odom' rather than guessing."
  ],
  "full_reports": [
    "reports/dryrun/dryrun_mock_graph_republish.json",
    "reports/dryrun/dryrun_mock_graph_fresh.json",
    "reports/dryrun/dryrun_live_graph.json"
  ],
  "how_to_rerun": "python 2ARM_ROBOT/sweepick/nav2_vslam_integration/run_ros2_readonly_dryrun.py --duration 12 --mock-graph [--mock-fresh-frames] --out <json>  (real robot: omit --mock-graph, add --console-status <read-only status json>)"
